Local DADA2 1.38.0 run on 17 synchronized forward/reverse FASTQ pairs.
Filtering: primer-free (no left trim), truncLen=0/0, truncQ=2, maxEE=2/2, maxN=0, rm.phix=FALSE.
Merging: minOverlap=12, maxMismatch=0, trimOverhang=FALSE; consensus de novo chimera removal.
Primary run: 218761 pairs passed filtering; 211207 merged; 447 merged variants; 141 bimeras removed; 306 ASVs and 203487 nonchimeric reads retained.
Sensitivity check: maxEE=3/3 retained 303 ASVs, with 301 shared with the primary result; primary maxEE=2/2 retained.
